{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"typedef","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSString#*$objc(cs)NSError)","text":"void (^)(NSString *, NSError *)"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This closure is called when the device registration process finishes, either successfully or with an error.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The handler receives two parameters:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"token","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The push token string if registration succeeded, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if it failed"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": An error object if registration failed, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if it succeeded"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle registration result with UI updates and backend sync:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["func registerForNotifications() {","    let registrationHandler: PushwooshRegistrationHandler = { token, error in","        if let error = error {","            self.logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","            self.updateNotificationStatus(.failed)","            return","        }","","        guard let token = token else { return }","","        self.logger.info(\"Push token received: \\(token.prefix(20))...\")","        self.updateNotificationStatus(.registered)","","        self.syncPushTokenWithBackend(token)","    }","","    Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications(withCompletion: registrationHandler)","}","","func syncPushTokenWithBackend(_ token: String) {","    let hwid = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","    apiClient.post(\"\/devices\/register\", body: [","        \"push_token\": token,","        \"hwid\": hwid,","        \"platform\": \"ios\"","    ])","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler"}],"roleHeading":"Type Alias","title":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","externalID":"c:PWTypes.h@T@PushwooshRegistrationHandler","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshFramework"}],"fragments":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"typealias"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshErrorHandler"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshRegistrationHandler"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwooshregistrationhandler"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completion handler called when push notification registration completes."}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS/documentation/PushwooshFramework/PushwooshRegistrationHandler":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","abstract":[{"text":"Completion handler called when push notification registration comple